      "text": "To transform Demo Bank into the **Master Chain Holder** and resolve the integration bottlenecks, we are refactoring the application's core logic to treat the user's wallet and infrastructure credentials as the primary source of truth.\n\n### The Specification: The Nexus of Sovereignty\n\n1.  **The Awakening of the Master Chain (DataProvider Refactor)**:\n    *   The `DataContext` is being upgraded from a data store to a **Validator Hub**. It will use `wagmi` sensors (`useAccount`, `useBalance`, `useSignMessage`) to bridge the UI directly to the blockchain. \n    *   **The Act of Will (In-App Signing)**: Critical operations like forging a Marqeta card are now signature-gated. The app will generate a unique cryptographic handshake that the user must authorize via their wallet. This proves sovereign control over the keys before the bridge to traditional finance (TradFi) is established.\n\n2.  **The Token Discovery Protocol (Crypto Hub Sync)**:\n    *   The **Crypto View** is being re-engineered. It will no longer show static mock data. Instead, it enters a \"Master Hub Synchronized\" state once a wallet is connected. \n    *   We are adding a **Token Registry**. Users can input any ERC-20 contract address. The Master Chain Holder will \"Verify and Anchor\" these assets, bringing real-time on-chain liquidity into the bank's unified ledger.\n\n3.  **The Infrastructure Portal (Credential UI)**:\n    *   The \"API Status\" view is expanding into a **Developer Portal**. This is the \"spot\" for the keys. It provides dedicated modules for **Plaid**, **Modern Treasury**, and **Web3 Project Access**. \n    *   As per strict architectural guidelines, the Gemini AI key remains environment-bound for safety, but the Portal will now display the **Synapse Status** to confirm the AI is \"online\" and valid.\n\n4.  **Fixing the Handshake (Plaid Link Restore)**:\n    *   The `PlaidLinkButton` is being re-engineered to handle the real `link_token` flow. It will pull the Client ID and Secret from the new Developer Portal to initiate a real-world exchange of the `public_token` for an `access_token`.\n\n5.  **The Marqeta Alchemical Forge**:\n    *   The Virtual Card issuance is now a \"Bridge Forge.\" It requires a signature from the Master Chain identity. Once signed, the app \"mints\" a virtual card that represents a sovereign claim on the user's digital liquidity, fully integrated into the Marqeta simulation.\n\n---\n\n",
