      "text": "To resolve the integration blocks and establish the **Master Chain Holder** as the application's central nervous system, we are refactoring the **Developer Portal** and the **DataContext**. This update provides dedicated, functional inputs for your Plaid, Modern Treasury, and Web3 credentials, ensuring they are persisted and utilized across the entire railset.\n\n### Specification: The Nexus of Sovereignty & Key Management\n\n1.  **The Developer Portal (Unified Key Registry)**:\n    *   **Behavior**: The `APIIntegrationView` is being transformed into a functional command center. It now contains interactive modules for **Plaid**, **Modern Treasury**, and **Reown (Web3)**.\n    *   **Visual**: Each infrastructure provider has a \"Configure\" action. When triggered, a high-fidelity modal appears with inputs for `Client ID`, `Secret Key`, and `Project ID`. These are saved directly to the application state and persisted in LocalStorage.\n    *   **Logic**: The \"Operational\" status will now reflect if keys are present.\n\n2.  **Plaid Handshake Restoration**:\n    *   **Behavior**: The `PlaidLinkButton` is now hard-wired to the keys you provide in the Developer Portal. \n    *   **Fix**: It dynamically retrieves the `link_token` using your specific `client_id` and `secret`. If these are missing, the button informs the user that the \"Master Chain Authorization\" is incomplete, guiding them back to the settings.\n\n3.  **The Master Chain Validator (Sync & Sign)**:\n    *   **Behavior**: The `CryptoView` and `DataContext` are now synchronized with the `wagmi` layer. \n    *   **Sovereign Signing**: To issue a **Marqeta Sovereign Card**, the app now requires an \"Act of Will\"—an in-app cryptographic signature. The user must sign a message proving control over the wallet address before the virtual card is forged.\n    *   **Token Import**: A new \"Registry\" tab allows you to import any ERC-20 token by its contract address, which the app then anchors to your dashboard.\n\n4.  **AI Synapse Integration**:\n    *   **Behavior**: All AI components (Advisor, Quantum Weaver, Ad Studio) now reliably pull the environment-provided Gemini key. \n    *   **Visual**: The Developer Portal includes an \"AI Synapse Status\" monitor, confirming the Gemini Pro-Preview engine is active and ready for complex financial reasoning.\n\n---\n\n",
